Bomb oracle hooks for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-11-04. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Lets the bomb probes run the bomb queue, the booby trap and planting boxes and the suspicious ground headless: with
gOracleMessageBoxHook set, DoMessageBox hands the box's text and callback to the hook instead of opening it, so the probe
answers it through the callback; appended accessors read the static explosion queue and its person, the allocated
explosions and the booby trap globals, free the explosions and the queue, run the static CheckIfNearbyGroundSeemsWrong
and finish the item locators (running their callbacks). The cosmetic Random draws on the probes' paths (the explosion
sound, the curse after a failed skill check, the stat-change quote, the battle sound variant) are marked 4001/4000 in the
draw trace of 0002. No behaviour change while the hook is clear. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0026.

